","Explodes upon death, dealing Arts damage to friendly units. Causes even greater damage if similar units of the opposite attribute are in its vicinity"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":3700,"atk":150,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"anxious_angry":{"slug":"anxious_angry","name":"Anxious 'Angry'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Anxious 'Angry'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A beastly Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. It has an even worse temper and doesn't want to eat apricots anymore. It follows its master's wishes and frolics about in the painting scroll, occasionally taking a bite out of it.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.9,"stats":{"hp":4500,"atk":380,"def":0,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.3}},"indefatigable_blindey":{"slug":"indefatigable_blindey","name":"Indefatigable 'Blindey'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Indefatigable 'Blindey'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A reckless Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Still rushes forward single-mindedly, as though its sole purpose in life is to march forward. Doesn't get along with Stabby. Can only be blocked by units of the same attribute.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by player's units of the same attribute."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1000,"def":750,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"unbridled_fury":{"slug":"unbridled_fury","name":"Unbridled 'Fury'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Unbridled 'Fury'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A strong Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Its great power and might is how it frees itself from the worries of having to think, allowing it to destroy all in its wake with its flaming inferno. Other than its buddy Bitey, that is. Gains attack power against opposite attribute enemies.","abilities":["Greatly increases ATK when attacking opposite attribute targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":1500,"def":900,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"free":{"slug":"free","name":"'Free'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Free'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A monster drawn by Dusk. It has a commanding presence and chilling arrogance, as though taking a page out of its master's book. 'The virid beasts. Like range on range. Eleven told. In moon, smoke-flow.'","abilities":["First Form","[Weft and Warp] Deals Arts damage to targets in the surrounding cross area, changing Hui-Ming attributes within its range","[Break the Chains] Deals massive damage in a large radius if the Barrier is not destroyed before it expires.","The first time HP drops to 0, enters Second Form","Second Form","Changes own Hui-Ming Attribute","Gains increased ATK and normal attacks hit twice","Additionally unleashes [Weft and Warp] on farthest target"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":600,"def":800,"res":55,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png","act16d5_token_inker_rep_1":"/item-icons/dusk_inkstick_act16d5_token_inker_rep_1.png"},"previewFile":"wr-ex-8.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[5,5],[4,5],[3,5],[2,5],[1,5],[1,4],[1,3],[2,3],[3,3],[4,3],[5,3]],"distances"